{"seq":56,"slug":"prompt-engineering","title":"提示工程","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering","rating":{"composite":4.16,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"提示工程\">提示工程</h1><p>提示工程（Prompt Engineering）是研究如何设计、优化和系统化地构造对大语言模型的输入指令，以获得可靠、高质量输出的工程学科。它不是简单的&quot;写好问题&quot;，而是一套包含结构设计、推理引导、输出约束、自动优化和质量评估的完整方法论体系。</p>\n<p>与本仓库中相邻 hub 的分工边界如下：本 hub 聚焦于&quot;如何与已训练好的模型高效沟通&quot;——从基础的 zero-shot/few-shot 范式，到 Chain-of-Thought 等高级推理技术，再到 DSPy 自动化优化框架和生产级提示管理系统。而「NLP 与 Transformer」hub 侧重模型内部架构原理（注意力机制、位置编码、预训练目标），「LLM 微调」hub 则关注通过梯度更新来改变模型参数（LoRA/QLoRA/DPO）。三者的关系可以概括为：Transformer hub 解释模型&quot;为什么能理解&quot;，微调 hub 研究&quot;如何让模型更懂特定领域&quot;，而提示工程研究&quot;在不改变模型参数的前提下如何最大化利用模型能力&quot;。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径根据读者背景分为三条线：</p>\n<p>第一条面向刚接触 LLM 应用的开发者——从基础篇的提示解剖学和 zero-shot/few-shot 出发，理解提示如何被模型处理，然后进入技术篇学习 CoT 和结构化输出，最后到实践篇了解生产部署。第二条面向已有 LLM 使用经验、想做系统优化的工程师——直接从技术篇的推理策略和系统篇的 DSPy 框架切入，再补充评估测试和安全防御。第三条面向 AI 架构师或技术管理者——重点关注系统篇的自动优化和评估体系，以及实践篇的生产管理与领域应用。</p>\n<p>前置知识：读者需要具备基本的 Python 编程能力，对大语言模型的基本概念（token、上下文窗口、temperature 等参数）有初步了解。如果不熟悉 Transformer 架构，建议先阅读本仓库的「NLP 与 Transformer」hub 中关于注意力机制的章节。</p>\n<p>本 hub 的内容截至 2026 年中更新，覆盖了 DSPy 2.4+、GPT-5.x 系列结构化输出、Claude Opus 4.x 的 JSON Schema 约束解码，以及多模态提示工程等前沿实践。所有技术论述均附有可验证的代码示例和性能基准数据。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prompt-anatomy-and-mechanics","title":"提示解剖学与工作机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/foundations/prompt-anatomy-and-mechanics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"zero-shot-and-few-shot","title":"Zero-shot 与 Few-shot 提示范式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/foundations/zero-shot-and-few-shot"},{"seq":3,"slug":"prompt-design-principles","title":"提示设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/foundations/prompt-design-principles"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"techniques","title":"技术篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"chain-of-thought-reasoning","title":"思维链与推理策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/techniques/chain-of-thought-reasoning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tree-of-thought-and-react","title":"思维树与 ReAct 范式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/techniques/tree-of-thought-and-react"},{"seq":3,"slug":"structured-outputs","title":"结构化输出约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/techniques/structured-outputs"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"systems","title":"系统篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dspy-prompt-optimization","title":"DSPy 声明式提示优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/systems/dspy-prompt-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multimodal-prompts","title":"多模态提示设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/systems/multimodal-prompts"},{"seq":3,"slug":"prompt-evaluation-and-testing","title":"提示评估与测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/systems/prompt-evaluation-and-testing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prompt-security-and-injection","title":"提示安全与注入防御","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/practice/prompt-security-and-injection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"production-prompt-management","title":"生产级提示管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/practice/production-prompt-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"domain-specific-applications","title":"领域应用模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/practice/domain-specific-applications"}]}]}